'''Gholdengo''' (Japanese: '''サーフゴー''' ''Surfugo'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

